r this product.'=>'Me ei leidnud selle toote eelvaadet.','There was an error rendering the email preview.'=>'Meili eelvaate kuvamisel tekkis viga.','There was an error rendering the email preview. This doesn\'t affect actual email delivery. Please contact the extension author for assistance.'=>'E-kirja eelvaate kuvamisel tekkis viga. See ei mõjuta tegelikku e-kirja kohaletoimetamist. Abi saamiseks võta ühendust laienduse autoriga.','Loading status data...'=>'Olekuandmete laadimine...','Export %d selected'=>'Ekspordi %d valitud','File path is not a valid upload path.'=>'Faili tee ei ole kehtiv üleslaadimise tee.','Unix timestamp representing when the incentive was dismissed.'=>'Unixi ajatempel, mis näitab, millal stiimul tagasi lükati.','The dismissals list for the incentive. Each dismissal entry includes a context and a timestamp. The `all` entry means the incentive was dismissed for all contexts.'=>'Stiimuli eiramiste loend. Iga eiramise kirje sisaldab konteksti ja ajatemplit. Kirje `all` tähendab, et stiimulit eirati kõigis kontekstides.','Return to shipping'=>'Tagasi saatmise juurde','Font size nameextra-large'=>'eriti suur','Font size namelarge'=>'suur','Font size namemedium'=>'keskmine','Font size namesmall'=>'väike','Font family namePacifico'=>'Pacifico','Font family namePermanent Marker'=>'Püsiv marker','Font family nameRaleway'=>'Raleway','Font family nameOswald'=>'Oswald','Font family nameSource Sans Pro'=>'Source Sans Pro','Font family nameRoboto'=>'Roboto','Font family namePlayfair Display'=>'Playfair Display','Font family nameOpen Sans'=>'Open Sans','Font family nameNoticia Text'=>'Noticia tekst','Font family nameMerriweather Sans'=>'Merriweather Sans','Font family nameMerriweather'=>'Merriweather','Font family nameLora'=>'Lora','Font family nameLato'=>'Lato','Font family nameArvo'=>'Arvo','Font family nameVerdana'=>'Verdana','Font family nameTrebuchet MS'=>'Trebuchet MS','Font family nameTimes New Roman'=>'Times New Roman','Font fam